flowchart TD
  cmd[ftp command] --> srv[ftp-srv server]
  client[FTP client] --> srv
  srv -->|listen on host:2221| started{Server started}
  started -->|connect failed| retry[Retry in 1 second]
  started -->|ready| login{Login event}
  login --> anon{Credentials configured}
  anon -->|no| resolve[Resolve served root]
  anon -->|yes| verify{Check username and password}
  verify -->|mismatch| reject[Reject connection]
  verify -->|match| resolve
  resolve --> root[(Served directory)]
